---LINES
---#sp      = h     "space "
sp      = iv    -       -       -       -     "|space|"






---SCREEN                                     
=vash context views and context switching keys

from main view:
 * lowercase letter key -                    ,---> ."main view"............    
    - type unix command from scratch (1)     |             ^|    |        |    
 * digit key or uppercase letter key:        |             || .'[a-z./]   |    
    - put a command template to editor (2)   | ."history". ||    |        |    
    - run programmed command (3)             |     |       ||    |   .'[0-9A-Z]
 .:CA... - switch between main view and      |     ^     .:CA... |     |    |  
   command editor, keeping editing content   |  .:HE...    ||   (1)   (2)  (3) 
                                             |     |       ||    |     |    |  
from command editor:                         |,> ."command editor". <--'    |  
 * .:HE... - get history view                ||    |                        |  
 * .:NL... - run a command                   || .:NL...                     |  
                                             ||    --> ."run a command". <--' 
from exit code indicator:                    ||              |                 
 * .:NL... - do nothing, preventing mistakes ||    ."exit code indicator ".. 
 * .:SP... - return to main view             ||         |    |   |     |   
                                             |`<- .'any_key  |   `<-- .:NL...     
                                             `---------<-- .:SP...           
 Please, use man vash for details

